# The component directories are INDEPENDENT git repositories with their own
# GitHub remotes. This umbrella repo deliberately does not track them --
# it holds only the cross-cutting docs that belong to no single component.
#
#   infra/         -> HarshitRawat11/app-hub-infra
#   links-service/ -> HarshitRawat11/app-hub-links-service
#   gateway/       -> HarshitRawat11/app-hub-gateway
#   aggregator/    -> HarshitRawat11/app-hub-aggregator
#   manifests/     -> HarshitRawat11/app-hub-manifests
#   n8n/           -> HarshitRawat11/app-hub-n8n
#
# ADD EVERY NEW SERVICE DIRECTORY HERE, in the same change that creates it.
# Forgetting does not fail loudly: the umbrella simply starts tracking a
# second copy of a repo that already has its own remote, and the two drift.
# `gateway/` was appended below the OS-cruft section rather than to this
# list, which is how it nearly happened twice.
infra/
links-service/
gateway/
aggregator/
manifests/
n8n/

# OS/editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
